ation:none;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px\\">Approve</a></td><td style=\\"width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0\\">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor=\\"#ffffff\\" style=\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d6d3d1;border-radius:8px\\"><a href=\\"https://x/approvals\\" style=\\"display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;color:#1c1917;font-family:'Instrument Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px\\">Open in OOOhm</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding:14px 4px 0;font-family:'Instrument Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#78716c\\">The Approve link is for you alone and stops working once the request is decided. To decline, open the request in OOOhm.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
